LavaridgeTown_Gym_1F_Text_H0_0::
	.string "FLANNERY: A champion from KANTO!\n"
	.string "Then I can give this all I've got.\p"
	.string "The heat here isn't just the springs.\n"
	.string "My POKéMON burn to battle, too!$"

